cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this validation package in academic work, please cite this
  repository. Please also cite the associated article once its bibliographic
  information is available.
title: >-
  Validation package for Surface-Mesh Projected-Density Simulation for Low-q
  Single-Shot XFEL Diffraction
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kim
    given-names: Minsu
  - family-names: Hwang
    given-names: Minwook
  - family-names: Jeon
    given-names: Hyonam
  - family-names: Seo
    given-names: Jongcheol
repository-code: https://github.com/SCIMMS/SAXS-simulation
url: https://github.com/SCIMMS/SAXS-simulation
abstract: >-
  Curated scripts, processed outputs, source data, and compact summaries used
  to validate the numerical accuracy, computational performance, and public-data
  comparisons reported in the associated article.
keywords:
  - small-angle X-ray scattering
  - single-particle imaging
  - XFEL
  - projected-density simulation
  - validation package
